{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-12","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量","englishTitle":"Magnitudes commensurable with the same magnitude are commensurable with one another also.","book":10,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.12/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","contentId":"euclid-10-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ba8b2dd258359c3fba4aff3cff73b941e92f9a9091545bb1dcf93c676342dc5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-12.statement","euclid-10-12.construction.1","euclid-10-12.proof.1","euclid-10-12.construction.2","euclid-10-12.proof.2","euclid-10-12.construction.3","euclid-10-12.proof.3","euclid-10-12.proof.4","euclid-10-12.proof.5","euclid-10-12.proof.6","euclid-10-12.proof.7","euclid-10-12.conclusion","euclid-10-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"595e85fbcac19bf1785d3fb9d1e49078c799e24ccb7c5b70b9b38288eee4fc47","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Magnitudes commensurable with the same magnitude are commensurable with one another also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同一星度的可公度 星系也相邻为可公度"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c138c3ca77317c9be912a300bcb51c88c15826b53d55968f7f2a0145e341967e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let each of the magnitudes A, B be commensurable with C; I say that A is also commensurable with B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A、B和C等值中的每个值为可公度;我说,A也是可公度和B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"92a64c7d7bcbda99f905376712766d13b7c2bcf8b95a4a907f18a34211dd5771","citations":["euclid-10-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A is commensurable with C, therefore A has to C the ratio which a number has to a number. [[X. 5](/principles/euclid-10-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A是可公度,C,A的比例为C,一个数字等于一个数字。 [[X. 5](/principles/euclid-10-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c77e8db5b1f92e4f3be4eb34f42fdf150e6acd777d5797d398ea64223513779","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it have the ratio which D has to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它拥有D比E的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5cbe0bcd4297276e903a7f7b62631b9ea90eefde937f14f3101e9127a6870e0e","citations":["euclid-10-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since C is commensurable with B, therefore C has to B the ratio which a number has to a number. [[X. 5](/principles/euclid-10-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于C为可公度,B,因此C的比例为B,一个数字等于一个数字。 [[X. 5](/principles/euclid-10-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db2c53573673e257c8cb4e60c36a67e1bdd0dcf649edee4914f1acbee61bff2e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it have the ratio which F has to G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它拥有F比G的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61bdf4b8890f7d81e3793406b82a8b4ddbd04d37195b7bd0446f99d05ccdc394","citations":["euclid-8-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, given any number of ratios we please, namely the ratio which D has to E and that which F has to G, let the numbers H, K, L be taken continuously in the given ratios; [cf. [VIII. 4](/principles/euclid-8-4)] so that, as D is to E, so is H to K, and, as F is to G, so is K to L."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不论比是多少,我们都会考虑,即D比E,F比G,让H、K、L等数字在既定比中不断计算,D比E等于H比K,G比L；D 与 E 之比等于 H 与 K 之比；F 与 G 之比等于 K 与 L 之比。 [cf. [VIII. 4](/principles/euclid-8-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"547dca215a2b16e3c5faac9a4e686d42554a32402dad17d7e86e535cd3d7d70f","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, as A is to C, so is D to E, while, as D is to E, so is H to K, therefore also, as A is to C, so is H to K. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,A对C的比等于D对E的比,而D对E的比等于H对K的比,因此,A对C的比等于H对K的比；A 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；D 与 E 之比等于 H 与 K 之比；A 与 C 之比等于 H 与 K 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a68ed442796c2584a1fd8c8b3f6c54d320845d896424c6095feab5d5d86ee64","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since, as C is to B, so is F to G, while, as F is to G, so is K to L, therefore also, as C is to B, so is K to L. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,C比B等于F比G,F比G,F比K比L,因此,C比B等于K比L；C 与 B 之比等于 F 与 G 之比；F 与 G 之比等于 K 与 L 之比；C 与 B 之比等于 K 与 L 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b0143bb5b0bf009874ccaf41e0eb63e64c196bdb94076425f7291ee0bb338dd","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But also, as A is to C, so is H to K; therefore, ex aequali, as A is to B, so is H to L. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A对C的比也等于H对K的比;因此,从平等角度看,A对B的比等于H对L的比；A 与 C 之比等于 H 与 K 之比；A 与 B 之比等于 H 与 L 之比。 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02120922efc7f0bbf0d41a2d9a3bf44ab67785da5da03a268288b70bd9a3f411","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A has to B the ratio which a number has to a number; therefore A is commensurable with B. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比B的比是一个数字乘以一个数字;因此,A是可公度和B。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-12.source","contentId":"euclid-10-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-12@raw-5ba8b2dd258359c3","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe9b0e970eb658392b1d6ea0f5c594cbd2ba8139433f30a0e898ad557ef93571","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.12/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.12\nCo